Package: MMSpower
Title: Malaria Molecular Surveillance (MMS) Sample Size and Study Design Power Calculations
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Sequoia", "Leuba", , "s.leuba21@imperial.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Robert", "Verity", role = "aut"))
Description: Sample size, power and analysis calculations for malaria
    molecular surveillance (MMS) studies. Designs studies to estimate a
    prevalence to a given precision, to test a prevalence against a
    threshold, to detect a rare variant, or to compare prevalence between
    two groups, and analyses the resulting data. Allows for imperfect
    diagnostic tests (sensitivity and specificity) and for clustered
    sampling across sites through the intra-cluster correlation and design
    effect. Also costs a study design by stage and by site.
